   "model": "muse-spark-1.3",
   "outcome_text": "root cause: Hurdle shape disabled + layer 2 vs mask 1 + collision exception, so no contact.\npatch: Force hurdle body to layer 1 with enabled shape; remove Hurdle collision exception in reset_to_spawn.\nwhy it satisfies: Solid 0.55 m wall spans corridor on player mask, so walk collides and E(t) stays \u22645px.\n",
